This subpackage contains Adwaita Mono, the default monospace font for 
GNOME 48+. It is a modification of the Iosevka font, customized to fit 
with Adwaita Sans, which is a variation of Inter with a disambiguated 
lowercase L.

The fonts and license are available on the GNOME GitLab instance: 
https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/adwaita-fonts
